{"parse": {"title": "迁流的盛宴/潜意识测试", "pageid": 123751, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p>该测试以小径形式呈现。小径问题中四个选项分别对应四种核心潜意识属性倾向。\n</p><p>最终结果基于各问题选项选择次数。游戏记录参与者在所有问题中的选择情况并统计四个属性倾向对应的选择次数，以出现次数最多的倾向作为最终结果。\n</p>\n\n<h2><span id=\".E6.B5.8B.E8.AF.95.E9.97.AE.E9.A2.98\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"测试问题\">测试问题</span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\".E2.85.A0\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ⅰ\">Ⅰ</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trail-container\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\">\n  <div class=\"trail-entrance\">\n    <div class=\"trail-icon hide-m\"><img alt=\"V3a2 dungeonpanel pic10.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a0/V3a2_dungeonpanel_pic10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"352\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"352\" /></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"trail-main\">\n    <div class=\"trail-frame\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; top:0; left:0; overflow:hidden; border-radius:0 20px 0 0\">\n        <div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"main-img\">\n        <div class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"width:48%; position:absolute; top:0; right:0; opacity: 0.3;\"><img alt=\"V3a2 dungeonpanel pic10.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a0/V3a2_dungeonpanel_pic10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"352\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"352\" /></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"trail-title serif\">书封之上</div>\n      <hr class=\"decorate\" />\n      <div class=\"trail-text\">在圣奥诺雷街的一家老书店里，一本褪色的旧书引起了你的注意，其内容正是你现在想要了解的。你再次用手指抚过它烫金的书名：</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>旁白\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>A</b></span></td>\n<td>《沙龙礼仪——由宫廷侍者撰写》</td>\n<td>是的，一本益于融入社会的书。\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>B</b></span></td>\n<td>《北非的兽群》</td>\n<td>是的，一本能够唤醒野性的书。\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>C</b></span></td>\n<td>《手持百合的爱人》</td>\n<td>是的，一本点亮彼此灵魂的书。\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>D</b></span></td>\n<td>《几何原本》</td>\n<td>是的，一本追问世界本质的书。\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\".E2.85.A1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ⅱ\">Ⅱ</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trail-container\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\">\n  <div class=\"trail-entrance\">\n    <div class=\"trail-icon hide-m\"><img alt=\"V3a2 dungeonpanel pic9.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/00/V3a2_dungeonpanel_pic9.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"352\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"352\" /></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"trail-main\">\n    <div class=\"trail-frame\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; top:0; left:0; overflow:hidden; border-radius:0 20px 0 0\">\n        <div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"main-img\">\n        <div class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"width:48%; position:absolute; top:0; right:0; opacity: 0.3;\"><img alt=\"V3a2 dungeonpanel pic9.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/00/V3a2_dungeonpanel_pic9.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"352\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"352\" /></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"trail-title serif\">面具之下</div>\n      <hr class=\"decorate\" />\n      <div class=\"trail-text\">一场化妆舞会正在蒙马特街区举行，它甚至没有一个确切的主题，但你必须戴上面具才被允许参加。于是你拿起了：</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>旁白\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>A</b></span></td>\n<td>打磨光滑，微笑得体的银质面具</td>\n<td>每个人都需要得体。\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>B</b></span></td>\n<td>风格粗野，雕以图腾纹样的木质面具</td>\n<td>面具也可以很“自然”。\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>C</b></span></td>\n<td>做工精致，饰以多彩羽毛的珐琅面具</td>\n<td>美的落点永远是吸引。\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>D</b></span></td>\n<td>依照你的面容绘制的，栩栩如生的纸面具</td>\n<td>暂且假装你还是你。\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span id=\".E2.85.A2\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ⅲ\">Ⅲ</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trail-container\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\">\n  <div class=\"trail-entrance\">\n    <div class=\"trail-icon hide-m\"><img alt=\"V3a2 dungeonpanel pic8.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3e/V3a2_dungeonpanel_pic8.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"352\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"352\" /></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"trail-main\">\n    <div class=\"trail-frame\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; top:0; left:0; overflow:hidden; border-radius:0 20px 0 0\">\n        <div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"main-img\">\n        <div class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"width:48%; position:absolute; top:0; right:0; opacity: 0.3;\"><img alt=\"V3a2 dungeonpanel pic8.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3e/V3a2_dungeonpanel_pic8.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"352\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"352\" /></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"trail-title serif\">愤怒之声</div>\n      <hr class=\"decorate\" />\n      <div class=\"trail-text\">游行和示威的口号声不绝于耳，你开始思考这个时代动荡的根源。那些焦虑、恐惧和愤怒的出现，你觉得是因为：</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>旁白\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>A</b></span></td>\n<td>道德的崩毁，人心的堕落</td>\n<td>可鄙的没有道德的家伙。\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>B</b></span></td>\n<td>文明的危机，原始的攻击欲望</td>\n<td>不过是猴子穿上了衣服。\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>C</b></span></td>\n<td>联系的断裂，人与人的隔阂</td>\n<td>没有人能理解另一个人。\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>D</b></span></td>\n<td>世界的失序，宇宙的失衡</td>\n<td>可能是神的脑子坏掉了。\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span id=\".E2.85.A3\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ⅳ\">Ⅳ</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trail-container\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\">\n  <div class=\"trail-entrance\">\n    <div class=\"trail-icon hide-m\"><img alt=\"V3a2 dungeonpanel pic7.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/52/V3a2_dungeonpanel_pic7.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"352\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"352\" /></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"trail-main\">\n    <div class=\"trail-frame\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; top:0; left:0; overflow:hidden; border-radius:0 20px 0 0\">\n        <div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"main-img\">\n        <div class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"width:48%; position:absolute; top:0; right:0; opacity: 0.3;\"><img alt=\"V3a2 dungeonpanel pic7.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/52/V3a2_dungeonpanel_pic7.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"352\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"352\" /></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"trail-title serif\">来自友人</div>\n      <hr class=\"decorate\" />\n      <div class=\"trail-text\">你好心的朋友寄来一张占卜明信片，据称卡片背面印制的图案代表了你本周命运的关键。你反转明信片，看到了：</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>旁白\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>A</b></span></td>\n<td>柔和缠绕的曲线</td>\n<td>绕过每一个孑立的钉子。\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>B</b></span></td>\n<td>转角尖锐的折线</td>\n<td>连纸面都被刺痛了。\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>C</b></span></td>\n<td>缺了一角的正方形</td>\n<td>仍是正方形，你看得出来。\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>D</b></span></td>\n<td>一个完整的圆</td>\n<td>最完整、最无懈可击的图案。\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span id=\".E2.85.A4\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ⅴ\">Ⅴ</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trail-container\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\">\n  <div class=\"trail-entrance\">\n    <div class=\"trail-icon hide-m\"><img alt=\"V3a2 dungeonpanel pic6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/13/V3a2_dungeonpanel_pic6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"352\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"352\" /></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"trail-main\">\n    <div class=\"trail-frame\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; top:0; left:0; overflow:hidden; border-radius:0 20px 0 0\">\n        <div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"main-img\">\n        <div class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"width:48%; position:absolute; top:0; right:0; opacity: 0.3;\"><img alt=\"V3a2 dungeonpanel pic6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/13/V3a2_dungeonpanel_pic6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"352\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"352\" /></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"trail-title serif\">争辩之声</div>\n      <hr class=\"decorate\" />\n      <div class=\"trail-text\">你正准备享用勃朗峰蛋糕和香醇的咖啡，邻座的辩论却越来越激烈。虽然他们打扰了你，但其中一位的观点你确实比较认同：</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>旁白\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>A</b></span></td>\n<td>“离群索居者是在逃避社会责任。”</td>\n<td>和被放逐没什么两样。\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>B</b></span></td>\n<td>“没有恶，只有未被社会承认的善。”</td>\n<td>标准总是在变化。\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>C</b></span></td>\n<td>“爱人是丢失在人间的一部分自己。”</td>\n<td>噢，浪漫主义情调。\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>D</b></span></td>\n<td>“人要认识到自己从一开始就是完满的。”</td>\n<td>所以我们到底在追求什么。\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span id=\".E2.85.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ⅵ\">Ⅵ</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trail-container\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\">\n  <div class=\"trail-entrance\">\n    <div class=\"trail-icon hide-m\"><img alt=\"V3a2 dungeonpanel pic5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b9/V3a2_dungeonpanel_pic5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"352\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"352\" /></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"trail-main\">\n    <div class=\"trail-frame\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; top:0; left:0; overflow:hidden; border-radius:0 20px 0 0\">\n        <div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"main-img\">\n        <div class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"width:48%; position:absolute; top:0; right:0; opacity: 0.3;\"><img alt=\"V3a2 dungeonpanel pic5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b9/V3a2_dungeonpanel_pic5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"352\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"352\" /></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"trail-title serif\">凝望自我</div>\n      <hr class=\"decorate\" />\n      <div class=\"trail-text\">香榭丽舍大街的橱窗前，你为一件事物驻足良久，连天空的变化都没有注意到。橱窗里的那个东西是：</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>旁白\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>A</b></span></td>\n<td>流淌着黑色液体的克莱因蓝礼服</td>\n<td>不得不说，衣品很好。\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>B</b></span></td>\n<td>古代魔精的复原画</td>\n<td>它们从一开始就这般吵闹？\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>C</b></span></td>\n<td>切成一半的烟斗剖面</td>\n<td>不禁好奇另一半在哪里展出。\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>D</b></span></td>\n<td>指针倒转的天文钟</td>\n<td>一定有着更深层的隐喻。\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".E6.B5.8B.E8.AF.95.E7.BB.93.E6.9E.9C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"测试结果\">测试结果</span></h2>\n<div class=\"trail-container\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\">\n  <div class=\"trail-entrance\">\n    <div class=\"trail-icon hide-m\"><img alt=\"V3a2 dungeonpanel pic4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/89/V3a2_dungeonpanel_pic4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"352\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"352\" /></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"trail-main\">\n    <div class=\"trail-frame\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; top:0; left:0; overflow:hidden; border-radius:0 20px 0 0\">\n        <div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"main-img\">\n        <div class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"width:80%\"><img alt=\"V3a2 dungeonpanel pic4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/89/V3a2_dungeonpanel_pic4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"352\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"352\" /></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"trail-title serif\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b><big>A</big><small><span style=\"user-select:none; padding-left:0\">&#160;</span>选项<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\">&#91;1&#93;</a></sup>居多：</small></b></span>所扮演的自己</div>\n      <hr class=\"decorate\" />\n      <div class=\"trail-text\">人之为人的全部历史都留存在人的脑中，称之为“种族记忆”。这些共同的、共通的记忆随着时间凝练成四种“原型”。经由“原型”的想象和表现，即为“集体无意识”。<br /><br />根据测评，你的精神内核与<b>“人格面具”</b>深度共鸣。<br /><br />你适应每一个时代。<br />得体与社会性是你的手段，只有秩序的堡垒才能抵御混乱的崩塌，不是吗？尽管依附正在倾塌的结构并不安全，但总归有下一个社会角色可以暂时容身。面具层层叠叠，你不介意扮演英雄或小丑、智者或愚人。你是你，也是芸芸众生。<br />谨记，带面具的人获得了身份，却也失去了自己的面容。</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"trail-container\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\">\n  <div class=\"trail-entrance\">\n    <div class=\"trail-icon hide-m\"><img alt=\"V3a2 dungeonpanel pic3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c1/V3a2_dungeonpanel_pic3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"352\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"352\" /></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"trail-main\">\n    <div class=\"trail-frame\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; top:0; left:0; overflow:hidden; border-radius:0 20px 0 0\">\n        <div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"main-img\">\n        <div class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"width:80%\"><img alt=\"V3a2 dungeonpanel pic3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c1/V3a2_dungeonpanel_pic3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"352\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"352\" /></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"trail-title serif\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b><big>B</big><small><span style=\"user-select:none; padding-left:0\">&#160;</span>选项居多：</small></b></span>所恐惧的自己</div>\n      <hr class=\"decorate\" />\n      <div class=\"trail-text\">人之为人的全部历史都留存在人的脑中，称之为“种族记忆”。这些共同的、共通的记忆随着时间凝练成四种“原型”。经由“原型”的想象和表现，即为“集体无意识”。<br /><br />根据测评，你的精神内核与<b>“阴影”</b>深度共鸣。<br /><br />你撕毁每一个时代。<br />你相信真理存在于理性之外，它存在于梦境、疯狂和原始冲动之中。崩坏的时代正符合这一倾向，在必要的毁灭之后，一切都将新生。这很危险，但值得，你感到被更古老、更宏大的冲动所召唤。你是你，也是世界的反面。<br />谨记，暗流是涌动的源泉，也是招致毁灭的深渊。</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"trail-container\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\">\n  <div class=\"trail-entrance\">\n    <div class=\"trail-icon hide-m\"><img alt=\"V3a2 dungeonpanel pic2.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/8b/V3a2_dungeonpanel_pic2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"352\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"352\" /></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"trail-main\">\n    <div class=\"trail-frame\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; top:0; left:0; overflow:hidden; border-radius:0 20px 0 0\">\n        <div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"main-img\">\n        <div class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"width:80%\"><img alt=\"V3a2 dungeonpanel pic2.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/8b/V3a2_dungeonpanel_pic2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"352\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"352\" /></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"trail-title serif\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b><big>C</big><small><span style=\"user-select:none; padding-left:0\">&#160;</span>选项居多：</small></b></span>所补全的自己</div>\n      <hr class=\"decorate\" />\n      <div class=\"trail-text\">人之为人的全部历史都留存在人的脑中，称之为“种族记忆”。这些共同的、共通的记忆随着时间凝练成四种“原型”。经由“原型”的想象和表现，即为“集体无意识”。<br /><br />根据测评，你的精神内核与<b>“阿尼玛与阿尼姆斯”</b>深度共鸣。<br /><br />你补全每一个时代。<br />冲突来自那些分裂的灵魂，怎能不挣扎呢？那些残损的、不完整的存在时时刻刻呼唤着所缺失的部分。一定有什么遗漏了，于是你必须巡寻回人间的另一部分自己，一个完满形象的幻想坐标等待着被印证。你是你，也是另一半自己。<br />谨记，投射预设了想象，而想象总会招致失望。</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"trail-container\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\">\n  <div class=\"trail-entrance\">\n    <div class=\"trail-icon hide-m\"><img alt=\"V3a2 dungeonpanel pic1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c2/V3a2_dungeonpanel_pic1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"352\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"352\" /></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"trail-main\">\n    <div class=\"trail-frame\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; top:0; left:0; overflow:hidden; border-radius:0 20px 0 0\">\n        <div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"main-img\">\n        <div class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"width:80%\"><img alt=\"V3a2 dungeonpanel pic1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c2/V3a2_dungeonpanel_pic1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"352\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"352\" /></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"trail-title serif\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b><big>D</big><small><span style=\"user-select:none; padding-left:0\">&#160;</span>选项居多：</small></b></span>所统合的自己</div>\n      <hr class=\"decorate\" />\n      <div class=\"trail-text\">人之为人的全部历史都留存在人的脑中，称之为“种族记忆”。这些共同的、共通的记忆随着时间凝练成四种“原型”。经由“原型”的想象和表现，即为“集体无意识”。<br /><br />根据测评，你的精神内核与<b>“自性”</b>深度共鸣。<br /><br />你就是每一个时代。<br />追求人格的中心与整体，也就是追求“自性”。无论世界如何动荡，你都在渴望一种更高维度的、更本源的、更永恒的秩序。内在的和谐与宇宙的和谐本就是完全相同的事情，为了抵达那里，任何事都可以被执行或放弃。你是你，也是时代的总和。<br />谨记，高维的解脱往往以低维的牺牲为代价。</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">此处指代上方问题中的对应选项字母。游戏内问题的选项顺序可能被打乱。下同。</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>", "categories": [], "displaytitle": "迁流的盛宴/潜意识测试"}}